  MergingAggregated
    GatherExchange
      Aggregating
        Aggregating
          Expression (Before GROUP BY)
            Filter ((WHERE + Change column names to column identifiers))
              ShuffleExchange
                ReadFromMergeTree (ParallelRead default.t_distinct_values)
